<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>register</title>
    <style>
        

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #000;
            color: #fff;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        

        .registe-block{
            display: flex;
            max-width: 900px;
        }

        .container{
            width: 100%;
          
        }

        .header{
            padding: 17% 0;
            padding-right: 10%;
            font-size: 10%;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 40px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        
        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
  
        input[type="text"],
        input[type="email"],
        input[type="password"],
        select {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 25px;
            background-color: #000;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            border-radius: 4px;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 16px;
        }



        input:focus {
          outline: none;
          border-color: #1d9bf0;
         }
        


         .btnTS {
           margin-top: 10%; 
            width: 110%;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid #1d9bf0;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 16px;
            background-color: #000;
            color: #1d9bf0;
            padding: 10px;
         
         }   
        .email-option {
            color: #1d9bf0;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 15px 0;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        
        .date-section {
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        
        .date-title {
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        
        .date-description {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            
        }
        
        .date-selectors {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            width: 110%;
        }
        
        .date-selector {
            flex: 1;
            
        }
        
        .next-button {
            background-color: #000;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: 30px;
            width: 120px;
        }
        
        .next-button:hover {
            background-color: #333;
        }
    </style>
    </head> 
    <body>
       
                 <div class="registe-block">
             
             
                     <div class="header">
                         <div class="logo">
                             <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" width="380"  height="380" fill="#edecec">
                                 <g><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 
                                     21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"></path></g>
                             </svg>
                         </div>
                     </div>
             
                     <div class="container">
                  <h1>Créer votre compte</h1>

        <form action="/register" method="POST">
    
            {{csrfField()}}
            
          
            <input type="text"  class="form-group" placeholder="Nom et prénom" name="fullName">
    
            <input  class="form-group"placeholder="Utiliser un email"  type="email"  name="email">
          
            <input class="form-group"placeholder="password"  type="password" name="password">
    
        <div class="date-section">
            <div class="date-title">Date de naissance</div>
            <div class="date-description">
                Cette information ne sera pas affichée publiquement. Confirmez votre âge, même si ce compte est pour une entreprise, un animal de compagnie ou autre chose.
            </div>
            
            <div class="date-selectors" >
                <div class="date-selector" >
                    <select id="month" name="month">
                        <option value="">Mois</option>
                        <option value="01">Janvier</option>
                        <option value="02">Février</option>
                        <option value="03">Mars</option>
                        <option value="04">Avril</option>
                        <option value="05">Mai</option>
                        <option value="06">Juin</option>
                        <option value="07">Juillet</option>
                        <option value="08">Août</option>
                        <option value="09">Septembre</option>
                        <option value="10">Octobre</option>
                        <option value="11">Novembre</option>
                        <option value="12">Décembre</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
                
                <div class="date-selector">
                 
                    <select id="day" name="day">
                        <option value="">Jour</option>
                        <!-- Générer les jours 1-31 -->
                        <script>
                            for (let i = 1; i <= 31; i++) {
                                document.write(`<option value="${i < 10 ? '0' + i : i}">${i}</option>`);
                            }
                        </script>
                    </select>
                </div>
                
                <div class="date-selector">
                   
                    <select id="year" name="year">
                        <option style="width: 100%;"value="">Année</option>
                        <!-- Générer les années (ex: 1900-2025) -->
                        <script>
                            const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
                            for (let i = currentYear; i >= 1900; i--) {
                                document.write(`<option value="${i}">${i}</option>`);
                            }
                        </script>
                    </select>
                </div>
            </div>
            <button class="btnTS" type="submit" class="next-button"> Envoyer</button>
        </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>